# seventyeight — the whole demo in 16 s: the band in the room, the bell, needle down (the band goes
# onto one worn 78 together, its room with it), the bell again (still clean: it is not on the
# record), more wear, needle up. Clicks at the record (110,100) and the bell (250,120).
click 120 250 120     # bell, in the room
click 300 110 100     # needle DOWN: onto the record
click 480 250 120     # bell while the band is on the record: must stay bright
down  560 UP
up    562 UP
down  600 UP
up    602 UP
down  640 UP
up    642 UP          # wear 0.5 -> 0.8: deeper sags, more crackle
click 840 110 100     # needle UP: back in the room
